@base = http://localhost:3500

### Is the salon agent up?
GET {{base}}/health

### A customer asks about Sunday afternoon
POST {{base}}/agent/conversations
Content-Type: application/json

{ "message": "Hi, can I get a haircut on Sunday afternoon?" }

### Book the 3pm with Leo
POST {{base}}/agent/conversations/conv_0001/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{ "message": "The 3pm with Leo, please. I'm Sam Lee, 555-0142." }

### Move it to Saturday at 4pm
POST {{base}}/agent/conversations/conv_0001/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{ "message": "Actually, can you move it to Saturday at 4pm with Leo?" }

### Cancel it: the agent asks first
POST {{base}}/agent/conversations/conv_0001/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{ "message": "Sorry, I can't make it this weekend after all. Please cancel it." }

### Nothing is cancelled yet
GET {{base}}/bookings/bkg_0005

### The customer says yes
POST {{base}}/agent/conversations/conv_0001/confirm
Content-Type: application/json

{ "confirm": true }

### Now it is cancelled
GET {{base}}/bookings/bkg_0005
